  "label": {
    "en": [
      "The postcard displays a black-and-white photograph of a woman standing in a rustic doorway, dressed in traditional rural attire typical of early 20th-century Galicia, Spain. The background appears to be a stone building. The text on the bottom of the postcard includes 'VIGO: ALDEANA', suggesting the subject is a villager from Vigo, and the publisher 'Hauser y Menet – Madrid.'"
    ]
